  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nCarries one nearby ally
    while both continue attacking. Rider and mount remain immortal. Mount pairing
    is automatic.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging
    three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA living
    mount bound to a circular route by a promise made on their behalf. They remember
    riders but no destinations. They choose passengers now and seek the first road
    that does not return by force.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal
    passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated
    percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed
    support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream shop or special
    reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: clock, tidal, knight.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
